WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.440
EPISODE 1

01:39.520 --> 01:41.440
REIGN OF RENZONG
IN THE NORTHERN SONG DYNASTY

01:41.520 --> 01:43.200
Boss, give me one that's fresh and hot.

01:43.280 --> 01:44.520
It smells pretty good.

01:44.600 --> 01:45.760
BIANJING

01:45.840 --> 01:46.680
Just a moment.

01:46.760 --> 01:48.400
- Alright, I'll take those then.
- Okay.

01:48.480 --> 01:51.640
Sesame oil. Top-quality sesame oil.

01:51.720 --> 01:53.560
- Steamed buns.
- Sesame oil.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.840
Nice and hot.

01:55.760 --> 01:56.880
Peanut cake.

01:56.960 --> 01:58.320
Come take a look.

02:05.280 --> 02:06.920
Let's get this one.

02:07.000 --> 02:08.880
- Nice and hot.
- Here you go.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.080
PAN RESTAURANT

02:21.160 --> 02:22.680
- Welcome!
- They have a new owner now.

02:22.760 --> 02:25.560
- Does Pan Restaurant sell Penglai Chun?
- Yes, it does.

02:25.640 --> 02:27.000
When it comes to good wine,

02:27.080 --> 02:28.880
the Meishou
from Baifan Restaurant is the best.

02:29.480 --> 02:30.360
Let's give it a try.

02:30.440 --> 02:31.520
Let's go.

02:31.600 --> 02:32.920
Waiter, table for three.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.320
Three gentlemen, please come.

02:41.040 --> 02:43.400
I can't feel my arms with you there.
Get up.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.480
MADAM LI

02:50.920 --> 02:53.320
ELDEST DAUGHTER, SHOUHUA

02:55.480 --> 02:57.280
Come on. Brush your teeth.

02:57.960 --> 02:59.600
Mom is really stingy.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.800
Why not hire a sedan chair
to go into the city?

03:01.880 --> 03:03.880
It's both convenient and respectable.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.760
So noisy.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.320
You're stepping on me.

03:09.800 --> 03:10.760
FIFTH DAUGHTER, LESHAN

03:10.840 --> 03:12.840
- Stop it. The vehicle is shaking.
- Quick.

03:14.680 --> 03:16.040
Oil spilled out.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.160
- Okay.
- You.

03:18.640 --> 03:20.200
Mom.

03:20.280 --> 03:22.200
Stop fooling around. Hurry.
There's hair oil left.

03:23.040 --> 03:25.560
- Come on.
- Only quiet when you're all asleep.

03:25.640 --> 03:28.080
- She's stepping on me.
- Don't move.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.680
Don't mention those darn people anymore.

03:31.760 --> 03:33.680
In broad daylight,

03:33.760 --> 03:35.080
they start daydreaming.

03:35.760 --> 03:37.800
They ask for 120 coins right off the bat.

03:38.400 --> 03:40.000
A hundred and twenty coins, seriously?

03:40.080 --> 03:42.920
Later, when we arrive
at your second sister's house,

03:43.000 --> 03:46.880
all the sedans
are yours to sit on if you like.

03:51.760 --> 03:53.160
No wonder everyone says

03:53.240 --> 03:54.960
Bianjing's splendor's
unrivaled in the world.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.080
Sister,

03:56.160 --> 03:58.480
look at that door.
They've even put up a decorative arch.

03:59.520 --> 04:02.160
There are many ladies
with flowers in the hair on the pavilion.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.280
Over here.

04:04.640 --> 04:07.240
- Let me have a look.
- Careful with the oil.

04:07.320 --> 04:08.800
- Your skirt.
- Be careful.

04:08.880 --> 04:10.800
Can you be a bit more mature?

04:11.560 --> 04:12.600
Pancakes.

04:13.240 --> 04:14.320
Here, kind guest. Have one.

04:14.920 --> 04:16.320
MADAM LIU, CHUNLAI

04:17.160 --> 04:19.880
QIONGNU

04:21.240 --> 04:22.400
PAN RESTAURANT

04:26.480 --> 04:27.320
Sis.

04:27.400 --> 04:29.400
Look over there.
Someone is gorgeously dressed.

04:30.000 --> 04:31.080
Isn't it new?

04:31.160 --> 04:32.920
Can we wear something like that
in the future?

04:33.000 --> 04:35.600
- Ask Mother.
- Let's settle down in Bianjing first.

04:35.680 --> 04:38.720
Then, I will find each of you
a good husband.

04:39.480 --> 04:42.360
I will have no regrets after that.

05:09.920 --> 05:12.560
CHAI AN

05:12.640 --> 05:13.800
- LIANG JUNQING
- My lord.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.920
Enjoy your meal, my lord.

05:23.000 --> 05:25.440
I'll be right outside.
Just call if you need anything.

05:28.920 --> 05:32.120
In this city, only Master Chai has wealth
worth 10,000 strings of coin.

05:32.200 --> 05:34.760
In the blink of an eye,
he took over such a large shop.

05:34.840 --> 05:38.800
But I heard the old owner has suffered
great losses for three consecutive years.

05:38.880 --> 05:39.800
Lost a lot of wealth.

05:39.880 --> 05:41.440
You faint-hearted ones.

05:42.800 --> 05:44.240
What kind of person is Master Chai?

05:44.840 --> 05:46.200
News was shared from the Palace.

05:46.800 --> 05:49.520
Whoever takes on the 20,000-gold
liquor taxes from Pan Restaurant

05:49.600 --> 05:52.280
will be authorized to open
1,000 liquor stores.

05:52.360 --> 05:54.480
You'll never need to worry about cash

05:54.560 --> 05:56.280
as it flows in like water.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.240
That'd be fantastic.

05:57.320 --> 05:59.240
Ordinary people might never get the news.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.880
Even if they knew,
who would have the nerve to execute?

06:02.760 --> 06:04.000
Right.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.920
Are you afraid of the cold?

06:08.000 --> 06:09.240
The windows are all shut,

06:09.320 --> 06:10.520
yet you're not taking it off.

06:11.040 --> 06:11.960
You're not a lady.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.440
A grown man going out wearing this?

06:15.520 --> 06:17.080
I was stung by a bee yesterday

06:17.160 --> 06:18.640
and got such a big swelling.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.960
I don't want to ruin the view.

06:22.800 --> 06:24.280
I am ashamed.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.120
I drank too much last night

06:26.200 --> 06:27.800
and took a tumble.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.360
Scared of being mocked
for being drunk.

06:29.440 --> 06:31.440
I hope you all will forgive me for this.

06:31.520 --> 06:33.080
No worries.

06:33.960 --> 06:35.080
Everyone, out.

06:36.160 --> 06:37.320
Out!

06:39.000 --> 06:40.000
I…

06:45.560 --> 06:46.800
Put it down.

06:52.080 --> 06:53.880
Such a big bee.

06:53.960 --> 06:56.280
- Was it your wife again?
- No, no.

06:56.360 --> 06:58.920
I was drunk last night
and got a bit intimate with the maid.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.080
FAN LIANGHAN

07:00.680 --> 07:02.240
My lady was angry, and we argued.

07:02.320 --> 07:04.960
I fell off the bed. But it's alright.

07:05.040 --> 07:07.120
You're so useless.

07:08.600 --> 07:10.840
- Let's go.
- Where to?

07:10.920 --> 07:12.560
I must personally meet your shrewish wife.

07:12.640 --> 07:14.800
Absolutely not, if you provoke her,

07:14.880 --> 07:16.720
she might just eat you up.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.520
FAN’S MANSION

07:18.600 --> 07:19.480
What bad timing.

07:19.560 --> 07:22.240
Our master and mistress
are away for the summer holidays.

07:22.320 --> 07:23.480
They are not at home.

07:25.160 --> 07:27.080
Please inform your master

07:27.160 --> 07:29.840
that his wife's family
has traveled far from Luoyang to visit.

07:29.920 --> 07:32.040
He has gone to meet friends.

07:32.120 --> 07:34.720
Then, when will he be back?

07:34.800 --> 07:38.920
At noon, he is usually at Sang's house.
Night entertainment after that.

07:39.000 --> 07:41.200
We wouldn't know when he will be back.

07:41.280 --> 07:43.240
- What's the matter?
- What does she mean?

07:43.320 --> 07:45.080
Then, please take the trouble to go again

07:45.160 --> 07:47.560
and tell our second lady
to come out and greet.

07:48.320 --> 07:50.840
She's gone to Xiangguo Temple
for charity events.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.400
Sorry for the trouble, madam.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.680
Please come again another day.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.920
Alright. Heading back.

08:01.960 --> 08:04.320
Sweep this away. How unpleasant to see.

08:09.120 --> 08:10.640
Madam, what are you doing?

08:10.720 --> 08:12.000
Not yesterday,

08:12.080 --> 08:13.520
nor tomorrow.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.600
Such a coincidence.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.080
We just arrived and everyone is out.

08:16.160 --> 08:19.600
It seems my mail was addressed to a dog.

08:19.680 --> 08:21.080
Madam,

08:21.160 --> 08:23.480
please don't be mad.
They are not at home, really.

08:24.080 --> 08:25.920
Go back and tell your master.

08:26.440 --> 08:28.280
When my second girl was back home,

08:28.360 --> 08:30.440
we always greeted distant guests
with proper manners.

08:30.520 --> 08:32.040
We never let them linger at the door,

08:32.120 --> 08:34.520
waiting without even a cup of tea.
This is nonsense.

08:35.120 --> 08:37.800
Our girl joined the Fan family
less than two years ago.

08:38.400 --> 08:40.600
She now turned her back
on her widowed mother and sisters.

08:40.680 --> 08:42.080
This is not marriage.

08:42.160 --> 08:45.680
This is uncivilized downgrading
to savages.

08:46.680 --> 08:47.920
As for that one,

08:48.000 --> 08:50.280
with an evil heart and rotten guts,

08:50.360 --> 08:53.280
I'll just assume I was blind
and raised them for nothing.

08:53.360 --> 08:55.520
You just go back and tell her.

08:56.320 --> 08:58.720
Even if I have to beg for food
from now on,

08:59.280 --> 09:01.480
I will never come here,
at the doorstep of the Fan family.

09:01.560 --> 09:02.680
Let's go.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.680
- But…
- No need.

09:07.040 --> 09:09.000
- What?
- Let's go.

09:20.160 --> 09:25.160
FAN’S MANSION

09:29.760 --> 09:32.840
SECOND DAUGHTER, FUHUI

09:43.280 --> 09:44.480
Mother.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.440
It's pitiful.

09:48.040 --> 09:49.760
Pity for my…

09:50.680 --> 09:52.240
200 strings dowry.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.040
Two hundred strings?

10:23.400 --> 10:24.840
FAN'S MANSION

10:41.120 --> 10:42.160
It's getting dark.

10:42.240 --> 10:43.280
Time to rest.

10:44.240 --> 10:45.360
You want to stay over?

10:47.400 --> 10:49.400
- Take off your clothes.
- My lord.

10:51.000 --> 10:53.320
I mean, I want to borrow your clothes.

11:33.840 --> 11:36.440
Mother, don't be angry.

11:37.000 --> 11:39.400
Second sister may have her own concerns.

11:41.560 --> 11:43.840
Mother, a decoction to calm your nerves.

11:43.920 --> 11:44.920
Have some at least.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.360
Raised for nothing.

11:49.320 --> 11:50.960
Really. Nothing.

11:52.440 --> 11:54.000
Terribly ungrateful.

11:55.160 --> 11:56.920
A beast without gratitude.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.160
Come.

12:11.560 --> 12:13.320
Take these 200 coins.

12:13.400 --> 12:15.200
Buy some donkey meat pastries,

12:15.280 --> 12:17.080
some mung bean soup,

12:17.160 --> 12:18.480
and some grass jelly to cool off.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.960
I am afraid Mom has no appetite.

12:21.040 --> 12:23.600
That stove looks rather clean to me.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.000
Please also borrow some rice.

12:25.080 --> 12:27.360
Ask Chunlai to make some rice porridge.

12:27.440 --> 12:29.720
We'll settle
the fire-lighting fee tomorrow.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.400
Do you know the way?

12:32.080 --> 12:33.720
Mother has a picky taste.

12:33.800 --> 12:36.320
You can go to Zhang's for pastries,
right across the street.

12:36.400 --> 12:38.800
Turn right and keep going
until you get to Second Street.

12:38.880 --> 12:41.800
With another hundred steps,
you'll see Wang's fish noodle stall.

12:41.880 --> 12:44.320
On the east side of the stall,
there is a Lucky Shoe Store.

12:44.400 --> 12:47.480
Next to it, Lin family's grass jelly
has a long queue. Buy from there.

12:48.120 --> 12:51.360
I wasn't able to see clear
during the bumpy ride.

12:51.440 --> 12:53.960
But thank you, my fourth lady.
You have a good memory.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.320
I'll go then.

13:00.800 --> 13:01.960
Mother.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.280
It's cold.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.120
Where is third lady?

13:13.200 --> 13:15.280
They said Master Chai

13:15.360 --> 13:17.040
invited quite a few people over,

13:17.120 --> 13:19.160
playing and singing.
The noise is incessant.

13:19.240 --> 13:21.160
Later on, he was too drunk to walk.

13:21.240 --> 13:22.520
He had to be carried back.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.480
What about my husband?

13:24.560 --> 13:27.400
The young master stayed with a girl

13:27.920 --> 13:29.760
in the side chamber.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.480
That naughty piece of shit.

13:35.520 --> 13:36.640
My lady.

13:36.720 --> 13:37.880
My lady.

14:05.880 --> 14:08.360
Fan Lianghan, you did take a vow.

14:12.880 --> 14:15.440
Can't believe such a violent wife
is from the Li family of Luoyang.

14:16.040 --> 14:18.080
Your late father
must be restless in his grave.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.640
A saying goes,

14:20.720 --> 14:22.960
"The violent one is heartless.
The ugly one envies."

14:23.040 --> 14:26.640
Five daughters from Luoyang Li family
are all famous for beauty.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.080
You are not ugly or heartless.

14:28.600 --> 14:30.360
Why so jealous?

14:32.160 --> 14:34.640
It should be between you two.
I never intended to do this.

14:34.720 --> 14:38.200
But you hit and scold your husband,
making domestic issues known all over.

14:38.280 --> 14:41.200
He is my cousin. I can't just ignore it.

14:42.160 --> 14:44.520
Marrying a good husband
should be a great thing in life.

14:45.120 --> 14:46.280
I advise you, sister-in-law.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.560
From now on, put away
this envy for favor and vanity.

14:49.640 --> 14:51.240
Don't break the seven rules for divorce

14:51.320 --> 14:52.640
out of temper and jealousy.

14:53.400 --> 14:56.800
Ending up a divorced and discarded woman
will bring disgrace to your Li family.

15:11.480 --> 15:12.320
Come out!

15:18.040 --> 15:19.880
Cousin, is that all?

15:19.960 --> 15:22.800
If Auntie hasn't begged me to,
I won't bother with your trivial matters.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.640
You two are never at peace.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.400
If she makes one mistake, you make nine.

15:27.560 --> 15:29.920
Her fierce and jealous nature,
I bet you've driven her to it.

15:32.400 --> 15:33.600
Fan Lianghan,

15:34.120 --> 15:36.560
if you dare fool around outside again
and word gets back to me,

15:36.640 --> 15:38.480
you'll get a hundred flogging.
If you die, fine.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.000
Cousin,

15:40.080 --> 15:42.960
I just look and talk about it.
I've never been serious about it.

15:43.040 --> 15:44.920
My wife is too fierce.

15:45.000 --> 15:46.960
Whenever a mosquito flies by,

15:47.040 --> 15:49.400
she has to catch it to check the gender.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.880
- Cousin.
- You're driving me crazy.

16:03.240 --> 16:05.240
I'll walk around. Do not follow.

16:07.680 --> 16:08.840
Go back.

16:24.920 --> 16:27.320
From now on, put away
this envy for favor and vanity.

16:27.400 --> 16:29.040
Don't break the seven rules for divorce

16:29.120 --> 16:30.520
out of temper and jealousy.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.760
Ending up a divorced
and discarded woman

16:33.640 --> 16:35.320
will bring disgrace to your Li family.

16:58.560 --> 16:59.720
Second sister.

17:15.680 --> 17:16.520
Kneel.

17:25.760 --> 17:27.320
In front of the sisters,

17:28.000 --> 17:29.760
share your thoughts.

17:29.840 --> 17:31.160
Make it clear.

17:39.040 --> 17:40.040
Madam.

17:40.560 --> 17:42.280
Second lady has suffered a lot.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.080
Second sister.

18:04.320 --> 18:05.960
When I first joined the Fan family,

18:06.480 --> 18:08.760
I was also favored by Mother-in-law.

18:08.840 --> 18:10.280
We were a harmonious couple.

18:11.880 --> 18:13.320
But as time went by,

18:13.400 --> 18:15.960
I found out Fan's eldest son
was soft-hearted.

18:17.120 --> 18:18.320
Those companions in the parlor.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.640
Strange girls playing flute and lute.

18:20.720 --> 18:22.000
Everyone was his favorite.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.960
Whoever cries about life in front of him,

18:25.040 --> 18:27.120
he would cry along with them.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.600
Often with red and swollen eyes,

18:29.680 --> 18:31.120
he came back with an empty purse.

18:31.920 --> 18:33.160
The elders pity their son.

18:33.680 --> 18:35.600
Told him off a few of times,
but he never changed.

18:36.520 --> 18:37.520
They just gave up on him.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.320
What is this?

18:45.200 --> 18:48.080
But it is not true if you say
he treats me poorly.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.720
The beaded treasures
and curios in my room,

18:50.800 --> 18:52.720
the royal girls might not have them.

18:52.800 --> 18:54.640
I wanted to learn to play Dakyu.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.880
He helped me a lot

18:57.400 --> 18:58.720
by organizing teams and clubs.

18:58.800 --> 19:01.960
In March, he took me to play water swings.

19:02.040 --> 19:03.920
He fell down from a high place,

19:04.000 --> 19:05.600
almost losing his life,

19:05.680 --> 19:07.120
all for me and my smile.

19:08.080 --> 19:10.480
Perhaps I am too jealous

19:11.440 --> 19:12.360
to be a virtuous wife.

19:12.440 --> 19:14.960
Don't give me excuses.

19:16.720 --> 19:18.200
I'm asking you.

19:18.280 --> 19:20.080
What is this?

19:21.840 --> 19:24.120
Chewing pebbles to overcome jealousy.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.760
Mother.

19:30.840 --> 19:32.320
I don't want to resort to violence.

19:32.400 --> 19:34.720
A bad reputation spreads far and wide.
But I…

19:35.840 --> 19:36.840
can never change it.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.760
Oh, Fuhui.

19:39.360 --> 19:42.680
Second sister is afraid of being a burden
on the Li family, on us.

19:43.280 --> 19:45.200
That's why she refused to meet us today.

19:46.120 --> 19:48.080
What are you talking about?

19:48.160 --> 19:49.120
No, it is true.

19:49.880 --> 19:52.920
Six fierce ladies of the Li Family
scared off all the matchmakers in Luoyang.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.360
If word spread in Bianjing
about another envious Li's girl,

19:55.440 --> 19:56.480
it'll be unbearably worse.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.360
I thought it was a big deal,

20:06.440 --> 20:07.560
like the end of the world.

20:08.320 --> 20:10.040
Among these five girls,

20:10.120 --> 20:13.280
you are the most alike
to your weakling muddle-headed father.

20:14.840 --> 20:16.480
Mother, you don't want me to bear it?

20:17.600 --> 20:19.040
Enduring is a temporary approach.

20:19.120 --> 20:20.440
But we are here now.

20:20.520 --> 20:23.360
We will make him change
instead of you tolerating everything.

20:25.000 --> 20:28.200
Third sister means that
looking back, families were ruined

20:28.280 --> 20:30.080
by too much drink,
lust, wealth, and anger.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.240
Excessive drinking and lust

20:33.040 --> 20:35.680
lead to gossip and quarrels,

20:35.760 --> 20:37.600
even to physical injuries and murder.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.880
There are countless cases in the world.

20:40.480 --> 20:43.360
Brother-in-law is young and impetuous.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.640
It is good for him to cultivate morals
and avoid disputes.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.360
If you are afraid of the gossip

20:48.440 --> 20:50.400
and indulge him blindly,

20:50.480 --> 20:52.240
it will lead to trouble in the future.

20:52.320 --> 20:53.560
That is not virtuous after all.

20:54.240 --> 20:56.440
Then, sister, what should I do?

21:06.560 --> 21:08.480
Tackling the root of the problem
is not difficult.

21:08.560 --> 21:10.520
I'm afraid that second sister won't do it.

21:10.600 --> 21:12.000
I will.

21:12.080 --> 21:13.400
As long as it is good for him,

21:13.480 --> 21:14.480
I will do anything.

21:14.560 --> 21:15.480
Then, no problem.

21:16.080 --> 21:17.960
If you follow my advice,
within half a year,

21:18.040 --> 21:20.040
if you tell him to go east,
he will never go west.

21:20.120 --> 21:22.160
Tell him to hold the plow,
he won't climb the ladder.

21:22.240 --> 21:24.640
He will become a compliant
and obedient husband.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.880
No, he will be a down-to-earth husband

21:26.960 --> 21:28.760
who earnestly mends his ways.

21:29.280 --> 21:31.480
All the same.

21:46.440 --> 21:48.320
Second sister,
with your beauty and virtue,

21:48.400 --> 21:50.120
he should do nothing but cherish you.

21:50.200 --> 21:52.880
If I were you, I'd beat him up and see
what's in his silly brain.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.240
Starting from today,

21:55.320 --> 21:58.080
he shall see the magic of our third lady.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.560
FAN'S MANSION

21:59.640 --> 22:01.480
My lord. My lord.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.560
My lord.

22:06.080 --> 22:07.640
The lady left a message.

22:07.720 --> 22:10.320
Your mother-in-law and sisters
have arrived in Bianjing.

22:10.400 --> 22:13.080
Today they want to visit our silk store
to pick some fabric.

22:13.160 --> 22:15.120
My lord, please stay at home

22:15.200 --> 22:16.800
and prepare a good banquet.

22:22.600 --> 22:25.120
What did you just say? Say it again.

22:41.480 --> 22:42.560
Fan Lianghan.

22:44.680 --> 22:45.680
Cousin, you are here.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.040
Didn't you say yesterday,

22:49.120 --> 22:51.280
the Zhuang's new store has taken
a lot of your customers?

22:51.360 --> 22:53.000
I am free today. I can go with you.

22:53.080 --> 22:55.000
Let's see what tricks
they are playing secretly.

22:55.800 --> 22:57.000
Get up.

22:57.080 --> 22:59.680
Behave yourself. Have you forgotten
what I told you some days ago?

23:00.880 --> 23:01.880
Cousin.

23:02.680 --> 23:05.680
My wife is not at home today.

23:05.760 --> 23:08.040
My wife is not at home today.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.880
My lord.

23:09.960 --> 23:11.080
The lady has returned.

23:12.040 --> 23:13.720
Hurry. Go.

23:13.800 --> 23:15.720
Quick. Hurry up.

23:15.800 --> 23:17.960
Go, go, go.

23:18.040 --> 23:20.000
There's no time.

23:20.080 --> 23:21.480
There's no time.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.560
It's too late. The lady has returned.

23:24.640 --> 23:26.120
Where can I hide?

23:26.200 --> 23:27.720
Where can I hide?

23:27.800 --> 23:29.280
The lady has returned.

23:30.240 --> 23:32.680
Here.

23:33.280 --> 23:34.160
Get out.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.600
No.

23:36.680 --> 23:37.720
Cousin.

23:37.800 --> 23:39.600
- Cousin, save me.
- Get up.

23:39.680 --> 23:42.360
- Save me, please.
- Stand up.

23:43.360 --> 23:44.560
Don't embarrass me.

23:51.080 --> 23:52.080
My dear,

23:52.160 --> 23:53.800
I have something important to tell you.

23:56.920 --> 23:58.520
This is the symptom of a migraine.

23:58.600 --> 24:00.640
Why is the doctor not here yet?

24:02.480 --> 24:04.440
The doctor is informed
and will be here soon.

24:04.520 --> 24:05.720
My lord, please bear it a bit.

24:05.800 --> 24:07.040
Hurry up.

24:10.960 --> 24:12.520
- My lady.
- What happened?

24:14.080 --> 24:16.160
It hurts terribly, my lady.

24:16.240 --> 24:18.200
Help!

24:18.280 --> 24:19.600
It hurts.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.920
Pain.

24:23.000 --> 24:25.640
Pain.

24:56.920 --> 24:58.040
My lady.

25:18.600 --> 25:20.000
You must've been drinking too much.

25:20.080 --> 25:21.880
Returned at night
and caught in the wind again.

25:21.960 --> 25:23.640
People often get sick by doing that.

25:24.840 --> 25:26.880
Fortunately, it is not difficult to cure.

25:26.960 --> 25:29.360
No need for a doctor. I can treat it.

25:31.120 --> 25:33.120
I wonder,
what kind of treatment are you preparing?

25:34.320 --> 25:35.600
Coming.

25:39.040 --> 25:40.800
My lady, the medicine is here.

25:42.880 --> 25:46.360
Come, my lord.
I will personally attend to you.

25:50.880 --> 25:51.920
Cousin Chai, rest assured.

25:52.000 --> 25:54.360
Once this medicine is taken,
it will cure all ailments.

25:55.280 --> 25:57.920
I've never heard of a medicine
that cures all diseases in this world.

25:58.800 --> 25:59.720
Is this really right?

25:59.800 --> 26:02.520
Indeed. Come on. Drink this first.

26:09.880 --> 26:11.960
What is this taste?

26:12.840 --> 26:15.240
My lord, this is a local remedy.

26:15.960 --> 26:19.240
Boy's urine. Specifically
for treating chills, fever, and headaches.

26:19.320 --> 26:20.280
Just bear with it.

26:23.120 --> 26:24.480
Hurry over and serve the lord.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.520
Go quickly.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.640
Come.

26:35.680 --> 26:38.920
If the lord refuses to take the medicine,
I wonder, are you faking the pain?

26:41.960 --> 26:45.160
- No.
- Not drinking?

26:46.360 --> 26:47.600
I'll drink.

26:48.800 --> 26:50.000
Here.

26:55.880 --> 26:57.200
Blame yourself for that.

26:57.880 --> 26:59.280
Finish it all.

26:59.360 --> 27:00.680
- It will all be fine.
- Who's there?

27:09.960 --> 27:12.120
Alright,
just spit it out and you'll be fine.

27:12.880 --> 27:15.400
Boy's urine?

27:15.480 --> 27:17.800
Third sister, is it really boy's urine?

27:17.880 --> 27:19.640
Of course not.

27:19.720 --> 27:20.920
It's just vinegar with water.

27:21.000 --> 27:23.520
Plus five spoons salt, six spoons
soy sauce, and three sugars.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.320
Among our five sisters,

27:25.400 --> 27:28.560
you are the most mischievous one.
Almost scared my brother-in-law to death.

27:29.760 --> 27:31.520
Third sister is always clever and crafty.

27:31.600 --> 27:32.800
If you ask me,

27:32.880 --> 27:34.680
this libertine's problem
is the easiest to fix.

27:34.760 --> 27:36.080
Just break his legs.

27:36.160 --> 27:38.480
Tie him to the second sister's bedpost,
and he'll behave.

27:39.560 --> 27:40.960
Just eat.

27:42.080 --> 27:44.480
In Bianjing, I am alone and with no help.

27:44.560 --> 27:46.200
Now, mother and sisters came.

27:46.280 --> 27:47.600
You are my core and support.

27:48.120 --> 27:49.000
It feels good.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.680
Two gentlemen.

27:50.760 --> 27:52.640
Young master is at the study.
This way, please.

27:52.720 --> 27:53.720
Let's go.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.400
Wait.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.640
Who is inside the pavilion?

28:04.480 --> 28:07.200
- Our young lady's family came to visit.
- Let me see.

28:07.280 --> 28:10.400
Those are Fan's beautiful cousins.
They came to the capital.

28:11.600 --> 28:14.600
I heard Fan praised them a lot,
saying they have unmatched beauty.

28:14.680 --> 28:16.440
As if they are goddesses
living in seclusion.

28:16.520 --> 28:17.760
Here, take a look.

28:17.840 --> 28:19.640
That's rare.

28:19.720 --> 28:21.440
I think we should go and pay a visit.

28:21.520 --> 28:22.760
Pay a visit.

28:22.840 --> 28:24.800
Absolutely not, sir.

28:24.880 --> 28:26.640
Won't make it hard for you.
Just have a look.

28:26.720 --> 28:27.800
Just a quick glance.

28:29.040 --> 28:30.560
No, please. You can't do it.

28:33.600 --> 28:35.440
Here, let me pour you a little more.

28:36.040 --> 28:37.120
From such a distance,

28:37.200 --> 28:38.480
we can't see their faces clearly.

28:38.560 --> 28:40.200
Who knows if they are beautiful or not?

28:40.280 --> 28:42.120
Yes, two gentlemen.

28:42.200 --> 28:43.840
You can't get any closer.

28:43.920 --> 28:46.280
If we get caught
for peeking at the ladies,

28:46.360 --> 28:48.320
not just us,

28:48.400 --> 28:51.160
the young master would be in trouble.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.080
Quiet down.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.280
I have an idea.

29:04.320 --> 29:06.760
This is unacceptable.

29:10.200 --> 29:13.120
I visit here often.
Sooner or later, I will meet the ladies.

29:13.200 --> 29:15.520
If you make a fuss,
I'll say you instigated it.

29:16.640 --> 29:17.800
I…

29:33.400 --> 29:34.800
I have prepared the rooms.

29:34.880 --> 29:36.800
Why don't you stay?

29:36.880 --> 29:37.960
Help me talk to Mom, please?

29:38.560 --> 29:40.920
Here, it is Fan's Mansion, not Li's.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.960
It is not proper for you unmarried sisters

29:43.040 --> 29:45.080
to stay long and treat
this as your original house.

29:45.160 --> 29:46.600
That will be a joke for all.

29:47.240 --> 29:50.440
Moreover, if relatives from
the maternal home stay long at your place,

29:50.520 --> 29:51.760
the Fan family will later

29:52.640 --> 29:53.760
look down on you.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.600
What?

30:05.640 --> 30:07.360
Why are you laughing without reason?

30:08.040 --> 30:10.680
A few days ago, I saw a joke in a book.

30:10.760 --> 30:13.120
It's funny but rather vulgar.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.720
I'm afraid to offend my sisters.

30:15.320 --> 30:17.360
I'll just keep it to myself
and enjoy it alone.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.800
I know you.

30:18.880 --> 30:21.520
If you don't say it, you will get gloomy.
Get it off your chest.

30:22.200 --> 30:24.160
- Share it now.
- Do tell.

30:24.920 --> 30:26.160
Well, then. I'll start.

30:27.400 --> 30:30.200
In the grand scheme of things,
nothing's more paltry than ants and flies.

30:31.080 --> 30:32.720
One day, however, they started to argue.

30:33.560 --> 30:35.440
The ant said, "Though I am small,

30:35.520 --> 30:37.800
there's a sense of sovereignty
and servitude in my behavior.

30:38.440 --> 30:39.520
When I find food,

30:39.600 --> 30:41.440
I will surely share with others.

30:41.520 --> 30:43.680
As for loyalty and filial piety,
I shall take the lead."

30:44.440 --> 30:45.920
The fly was not convinced.

30:46.000 --> 30:49.800
"That's all well, but none enjoys as I do.
In the imperial palaces and gardens,

30:49.880 --> 30:51.000
the mansions of the wealthy,

30:51.080 --> 30:52.480
and during grand feasts,

30:52.560 --> 30:54.720
I can enter and roam at will

30:54.800 --> 30:56.920
and enjoy freely.
I should be the leader."

30:58.080 --> 31:00.440
Upon hearing this, the mosquito
expressed its dissent.

31:00.520 --> 31:02.760
"Though you two speak of loyalty,
filial piety, and wealth,

31:02.840 --> 31:05.000
none of you lives as joyfully
and freely as I do."

31:10.920 --> 31:12.240
How so?

31:12.320 --> 31:15.520
"In the dead of night, when all is still,
within the fragrant lady's quarters,

31:15.600 --> 31:17.240
I am free to come and go.

31:17.760 --> 31:20.480
Regardless of her status being
a princess or a noble lady,

31:20.560 --> 31:21.800
a heroine or a goddess,

31:21.880 --> 31:24.560
I only choose the sweetest
and most delicate spots to feast upon

31:25.400 --> 31:27.000
and only stop when I am fully satisfied."

31:27.600 --> 31:29.480
Hearing this, the ant and the fly
were furious.

31:31.880 --> 31:34.160
"Look at you, with your sharp snout.
Such lechery."

31:35.040 --> 31:36.240
How dare you?

31:36.320 --> 31:37.520
Do you know who my uncle is?

31:37.600 --> 31:41.360
Even if I took you as a concubine,
it'd be a miracle for your family.

31:41.440 --> 31:43.920
Mess with me,
you and the Li family will be in trouble.

31:44.000 --> 31:44.960
Scoundrel.

31:45.040 --> 31:46.520
- Take my shovel.
- Fifth sister.

31:51.320 --> 31:52.360
You.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.520
Help.

32:02.080 --> 32:04.240
You blind hedonist, shameless beast!

32:04.320 --> 32:06.240
How dare you even dream
of taking my sister.

32:06.320 --> 32:08.200
So covetous of the prosperity
for my family,

32:08.280 --> 32:10.000
why don't you come over and kowtow to me?

32:10.080 --> 32:13.520
If you don't shut your foul mouth
and take back your frivolous talks,

32:13.600 --> 32:16.160
watch out for my shovel.
It will mash up your wolfish heart.

32:16.240 --> 32:18.720
I'll pull out your filthy intestines

32:18.800 --> 32:20.400
and feed you with firecrackers.

32:20.480 --> 32:22.000
You'll never reincarnate after death.

32:23.200 --> 32:25.880
Fifth sister, please stay calm.

32:30.520 --> 32:32.320
- You…
- What?

32:40.240 --> 32:41.400
Remember.

32:41.480 --> 32:43.680
It is the third lady of Li
who beats you today.

32:43.760 --> 32:44.960
Nothing to do with anyone else.

32:45.680 --> 32:47.360
You disguised as maids in broad daylight,

32:47.440 --> 32:48.800
peeking at ladies.

32:48.880 --> 32:51.120
Bullied with borrowed power,
a fox masquerading as a tiger.

32:51.840 --> 32:53.920
Despicable and lowly,
shameless and heartless.

32:54.760 --> 32:58.120
If you don't accept this, go
to the Bureau for Letters to talk it out.

32:58.200 --> 33:00.920
Even if your uncle is some dragon king
or god of the mountains,

33:01.000 --> 33:02.320
the laws of Song still prevail.

33:02.920 --> 33:05.000
The imperial censors in the city
will not tolerate it.

33:05.080 --> 33:07.960
Certainly, they will inquire about
allowing his nephew's misconduct.

33:08.560 --> 33:11.040
I want to see how you can escape that.

33:11.760 --> 33:13.120
I won't dare.

33:18.160 --> 33:20.560
My fault.
Sorry for the interruption, ladies.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.880
Who let them in? Seize them!

33:22.960 --> 33:25.640
They love to dress as women, don't they?
We have time for that.

33:25.720 --> 33:28.360
- Exactly.
- Guards, take them away.

33:34.840 --> 33:35.840
Mother.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.400
- Very well.
- Mother.

33:37.480 --> 33:39.480
Mother, look at her,
causing trouble again.

33:42.320 --> 33:43.640
Big sister.

33:43.720 --> 33:44.640
No nonsense.

33:45.240 --> 33:47.080
If the host recognizes them,
they'll be guests.

33:47.160 --> 33:48.680
If not, they are lascivious thieves.

33:49.520 --> 33:52.120
Even if you beat them to death,
no one would hold you accountable.

33:53.440 --> 33:55.880
Alright. Let's go back.

33:55.960 --> 33:57.280
Return to the inn soon.

33:59.920 --> 34:01.200
Cousin.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.600
- Cousin.
- Speak properly.

34:03.680 --> 34:05.760
What are you ranting about?
It's rather disgusting.

34:05.840 --> 34:07.000
Cousin.

34:07.080 --> 34:08.400
My mother-in-law and her daughters

34:08.480 --> 34:09.640
have all come to Bianjing.

34:09.720 --> 34:11.000
How can I survive in the future?

34:11.080 --> 34:12.400
The Li families are all women.

34:12.480 --> 34:14.560
Just take good care of them.
What're you talking about?

34:15.160 --> 34:17.200
Cousin, you don't know.

34:17.280 --> 34:19.240
Save me, Fan.

34:20.280 --> 34:22.160
- Save me.
- Save me, Fan.

34:22.240 --> 34:23.080
In the garden.

34:24.080 --> 34:25.920
You have offended my wife?

34:26.000 --> 34:27.240
My wife hit you?

34:27.320 --> 34:28.480
You're going to get me killed.

34:28.560 --> 34:30.000
No, we won't dare.

34:30.080 --> 34:32.720
- Not your wife.
- It was a young lady with a nice voice.

34:33.320 --> 34:35.360
Very fierce, quite scary.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.440
There's also a scourge.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.520
She hit me like this.

34:37.600 --> 34:39.520
- Beating me without warning.
- Yes.

34:39.600 --> 34:41.640
Her curses were terrible.

34:41.720 --> 34:43.160
Extremely terrible.

34:43.240 --> 34:44.600
I thought young ladies were shy

34:44.680 --> 34:46.840
and wouldn't do anything
if they noticed us.

34:46.920 --> 34:49.680
Who would have thought?

34:50.280 --> 34:51.640
This is not surprising.

34:51.720 --> 34:54.000
The Li family in Luoyang
had many hectares of good farmland.

34:54.560 --> 34:56.480
Unfortunately,
my father-in-law passed away early.

34:56.560 --> 34:57.680
The son died prematurely too.

34:57.760 --> 35:00.080
In this house, where masculinity
ended, if the woman is weak,

35:00.160 --> 35:02.320
they won't be able to protect
their family property.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.240
That's right.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.560
They also said

35:09.080 --> 35:11.960
- the ones you associate with are evil too.
- Right.

35:12.040 --> 35:13.400
Now, they'll hit once they see one.

35:13.480 --> 35:15.320
- No matter if it is two or a dozen.
- Yes.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.840
- Especially Mr. Chai.
- Right.

35:18.360 --> 35:19.960
Still trying to provoke me with lies?

35:20.040 --> 35:21.800
I don't know her.
Why hit me without reason?

35:22.560 --> 35:25.600
She said you're the one instigating Fan
to reinforce the male authority.

35:25.680 --> 35:27.720
On normal days,
too proud to see the dust beneath.

35:27.800 --> 35:30.200
The most arrogant and rude one.
Mr. Chai, you must be careful.

35:31.040 --> 35:33.560
That one who did the beating
must be the fifth lady.

35:33.640 --> 35:36.120
The one who did the talking
must be the third lady.

35:36.720 --> 35:38.800
The fifth lady smiles
at everyone she meets.

35:38.880 --> 35:41.720
But her mother and elder sisters
can never be dishonored in front of her.

35:41.800 --> 35:43.240
It's your fault for being indecent.

35:44.920 --> 35:47.520
- I made a mistake.
- The third lady who fed you with vinegar.

35:51.400 --> 35:53.000
She wants to get even with me.

35:53.080 --> 35:54.360
Good.

35:54.440 --> 35:55.840
I look forward to the challenge.

35:56.800 --> 35:59.440
Cousin, you mustn't go. It's a suicide.

35:59.520 --> 36:00.360
- Don't go.
- Mr. Chai.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.480
- Mr. Chai.
- Stop him.

36:01.560 --> 36:03.080
Quick, stop him.

36:12.680 --> 36:13.600
Mother.

36:13.680 --> 36:15.320
Stay a little longer.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.440
I can come again next time.

36:17.880 --> 36:19.480
Stay for a few more days.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.480
Mother.

36:23.680 --> 36:24.680
Third sister.

36:31.880 --> 36:33.000
You.

36:33.520 --> 36:34.800
No, sis, you can't do it.

36:42.480 --> 36:43.680
Mr. Liang.

36:44.720 --> 36:46.920
Mr. Liang.

36:47.000 --> 36:48.440
Are you alright?

36:50.360 --> 36:51.760
I can see many birds around me.

36:52.640 --> 36:54.640
You're so silly. Why didn't you dodge?

36:55.880 --> 36:57.360
Who is playing cuju over there?

36:58.240 --> 36:59.280
Get up quickly.

37:01.720 --> 37:03.520
My name is Chai An.

37:03.600 --> 37:05.080
I am a friend of this house.

37:05.160 --> 37:07.040
The ball slipped away.
I should be more careful.

37:07.120 --> 37:09.600
I ask for Lady Li
and the other ladies' forgiveness.

37:09.680 --> 37:12.320
If I broke anything,
I will pay for it at double the price.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.600
- Who is the man playing cuju…
- Mother-in-law.

37:14.680 --> 37:15.800
- …with third sister?
- My lady.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.040
- Sisters-in-law.
- I don't know.

37:17.120 --> 37:19.640
Mr. Chai's my cousin. He doesn't know
they were in the garden.

37:19.720 --> 37:21.040
He showed off but people got hurt.

37:21.600 --> 37:22.880
It's my fault for not explaining.

37:22.960 --> 37:24.600
It was completely unintentional.

37:24.680 --> 37:26.080
Blame me. It's all my fault.

37:26.880 --> 37:27.760
Mother.

37:28.280 --> 37:30.320
The Chai and Fan families
share a deep friendship.

37:30.400 --> 37:32.360
Mr. Chai
is a frequent visitor in our home.

37:32.440 --> 37:34.000
Usually, he is the most courteous one.

37:34.080 --> 37:36.320
He certainly
didn't mean to offend the ladies.

37:36.400 --> 37:38.960
Shall we be over with it, for me?

37:40.160 --> 37:42.920
This gentleman is quite handsome.

37:43.000 --> 37:44.480
He brings joy at first sight.

37:44.560 --> 37:46.320
Are you…?

37:49.920 --> 37:51.280
Never mind.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.800
Sure, all is good.

37:52.880 --> 37:54.880
Then we shall leave now.

37:55.920 --> 37:57.560
Let me show you the way.

37:57.640 --> 37:58.680
Let's go.

38:19.080 --> 38:21.040
That was close. Dodged a bullet.

38:21.120 --> 38:23.920
You deserved it. This concubine nonsense.

38:24.000 --> 38:27.000
If you sincerely apologize,
she won't be that angry.

38:32.960 --> 38:34.120
It's her.

38:36.320 --> 38:38.200
Such a refreshing and stunning lady.

38:38.280 --> 38:40.040
She is the one and only in Bianjing.

38:40.560 --> 38:42.400
You deserved that hit from the ball.

38:48.920 --> 38:51.000
Please return the hairpin comb to my lady.

39:35.240 --> 39:36.240
Come try it.

39:36.320 --> 39:39.360
That gentleman playing cuju
has a good demeanor.

39:39.440 --> 39:42.440
He's much different from
the previous two with their sneaky looks.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.240
Is he married?

39:45.640 --> 39:48.720
When you approached the city,
did you see the gardens on the outskirts?

39:48.800 --> 39:49.920
Yes.

39:50.000 --> 39:52.120
One after another,
stretching as far as the eye can see.

39:53.160 --> 39:54.360
It all belongs to his family?

39:54.440 --> 39:56.800
The Chai family acquired a lot of land

39:56.880 --> 39:58.440
on the outskirts of the city early on.

39:58.520 --> 40:00.600
They hired skilled people
to plant vegetables widely.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.800
Even during the cold winter,

40:01.880 --> 40:04.680
fresh chive shoots and purslanes
are never short of supply.

40:05.800 --> 40:08.200
One acre of the garden
is worth ten acres of farmland.

40:08.280 --> 40:10.920
One can tell the wealth of his family
without asking.

40:11.800 --> 40:13.080
It's nothing special to own land.

40:13.160 --> 40:15.680
We also have good fields in Luoyang.

40:16.400 --> 40:17.440
Mother, think about it.

40:17.520 --> 40:20.920
Bianjing has all the princes,
dukes, ministers, and dignitaries.

40:21.000 --> 40:22.960
How do they let ordinary people
have good benefits?

40:24.640 --> 40:25.960
What I will be sharing today,

40:26.040 --> 40:27.520
sisters, just take it as a joke.

40:27.600 --> 40:28.960
Nobody should take it seriously.

40:31.240 --> 40:34.200
It is said that Emperor Taizu,
during his humble beginnings,

40:34.280 --> 40:36.480
received kindness
from Emperor Shizong of the Great Zhou.

40:37.080 --> 40:40.120
In the end,
the Zhao family took their empire.

40:40.200 --> 40:42.640
It's inevitable they feel guilt towards
Chai family descendants.

40:42.720 --> 40:45.080
Rumors say that Emperor Shizong of Zhou
had seven sons.

40:45.160 --> 40:47.360
Some died early.
Some had unknown whereabouts.

40:48.080 --> 40:50.760
Some adopted by prominent officials
under Emperor Taizu's instruction.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.520
Their surnames were changed to Pan and Lu.

40:52.600 --> 40:55.280
Back to now,
after generations of his family,

40:55.360 --> 40:57.600
it is hard to tell the truth.

40:58.720 --> 41:01.120
I've only heard he spoke once
carelessly after drinking.

41:01.200 --> 41:03.880
The family still offered incense
to the cinnabar edict.

41:04.480 --> 41:06.560
- Really?
- Oh my goodness.

41:08.480 --> 41:09.960
Grandma often said

41:10.040 --> 41:11.720
the Fan family is considered wealthy.

41:11.800 --> 41:13.920
But it is nothing
compared to their family.

41:14.840 --> 41:17.880
Thanks to the Chai family's consideration
of old sentiments, they look after us.

41:18.480 --> 41:20.080
Although he tends to meddle too much,

41:20.160 --> 41:22.560
he is the only one sincerely
helping my husband

41:22.640 --> 41:23.640
in his career and life.

41:24.520 --> 41:25.840
In that case,

41:25.920 --> 41:28.240
Master Chai must already
have a marriage arranged.

41:29.080 --> 41:30.400
He is a man with his own ideas.

41:30.480 --> 41:33.480
Ordinary women do not catch his eye.

41:33.560 --> 41:35.720
I think, sooner or later,
he will marry a noble woman.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.480
All that chatter.

41:39.080 --> 41:40.880
If he doesn't marry my dear daughters,

41:40.960 --> 41:42.560
who cares about his future bride.

41:42.640 --> 41:45.280
It has nothing to do
with our family, right?

41:46.920 --> 41:48.200
Had I known this,

41:48.280 --> 41:50.080
I should've taught him a lesson earlier.

41:51.360 --> 41:53.080
Ask him to pay the head comb.

41:54.440 --> 41:55.520
Wasted good intentions.

41:57.200 --> 42:00.760
Mother, I've found a good house agent

42:00.840 --> 42:03.520
to rent a quiet residence
near the Fan's Mansion.

42:03.600 --> 42:05.080
Shall we go and check on the house?

42:07.880 --> 42:10.800
I still have important things
to take care of.

42:12.760 --> 42:14.880
Third daughter, you come with me.

42:15.680 --> 42:16.640
Okay.

42:19.560 --> 42:22.200
Eldest daughter, Shouhua.

42:24.160 --> 42:28.720
This is my third daughter, Kangning.

42:29.880 --> 42:31.000
This one

42:31.080 --> 42:34.400
is my fourth daughter, Haode.

42:35.440 --> 42:36.440
And this

42:36.520 --> 42:39.720
is my youngest fifth daughter, Leshan.

42:41.320 --> 42:42.360
Alright.

42:45.160 --> 42:46.160
Ms. Liu,

42:46.680 --> 42:49.720
please don't forget to remind me later.

42:49.800 --> 42:53.960
After offering the incense,
pack up all the portraits to take back.

42:54.680 --> 42:55.520
Okay.

42:57.160 --> 43:00.160
Bodhisattva, I offer you incense.

43:14.480 --> 43:16.040
Bodhisattva.

43:16.120 --> 43:18.600
Devout woman here, sincerely praying.

43:18.680 --> 43:21.840
May my daughter's marriage be smooth.

43:21.920 --> 43:24.520
The fourth and fifth daughters can wait.

43:24.600 --> 43:26.840
But the eldest, Shouhua,

43:26.920 --> 43:28.600
widowed at a young age,

43:28.680 --> 43:30.400
wasting her youth.

43:30.480 --> 43:32.000
And the third daughter, Kangning,

43:32.080 --> 43:33.840
with a fierce temperament,

43:33.920 --> 43:35.800
finding her a partner isn't easy.

43:35.880 --> 43:37.800
They really can't wait any longer.

43:37.880 --> 43:41.520
I don't ask for a son-in-law
to be very wealthy or noble.

43:41.600 --> 43:43.000
But I wish my daughter

43:43.080 --> 43:45.280
will find a good man

43:45.360 --> 43:46.680
to support her all her life.

43:47.280 --> 43:50.880
I pray for the Bodhisattva's blessing
for mother's and sisters' health

43:50.960 --> 43:53.040
for our family
to have a roof over our heads

43:53.120 --> 43:54.520
and a place to stand our ground.

43:55.040 --> 43:57.120
Live in peace with simple tea and meals.

43:57.640 --> 43:58.960
These are all my wishes.

43:59.040 --> 44:00.840
Thinking only of her own daughters,

44:00.920 --> 44:03.240
in this world, who will pity me?

44:03.920 --> 44:06.840
They have suffered a lot
since they were young.

44:06.920 --> 44:10.920
So, I hope for the rest of their lives,
they can find good husbands

44:11.000 --> 44:14.160
and live simple and harmonious lives.

44:14.240 --> 44:16.600
- Thief! Mom.
- Don't run.

44:16.680 --> 44:18.120
- He took our things.
- Don't run.

44:18.200 --> 44:19.840
- Thief.
- Stop the thief.

44:19.920 --> 44:21.240
Catch the thief!

44:21.320 --> 44:22.640
Slow down, Mother.

44:23.160 --> 44:24.720
- Mother.
- Take it slow.

44:24.800 --> 44:26.840
Is it because you know my daughters
can't get married?

44:26.920 --> 44:28.480
- Don't move.
- I met respectable families.

44:28.560 --> 44:29.720
- I'll hit you.
- Mother.

44:29.800 --> 44:32.360
- Alright.
- Don't be angry with him.

44:32.440 --> 44:33.760
Mother, calm down, please.

44:33.840 --> 44:36.000
How can there be
such a vulgar woman in the world?

44:36.080 --> 44:38.320
What kind of place is this
to tolerate her nonsense?

44:38.400 --> 44:40.560
She keeps saying
she is marrying off her daughter.

44:40.640 --> 44:43.080
A daughter of such a family,
who would dare to propose to her?

44:43.160 --> 44:44.440
I can't stand it here.

44:44.520 --> 44:45.960
It is filled with filthy noise.

44:46.040 --> 44:47.480
- Let's go inside.
- Okay.

44:47.560 --> 44:49.600
- Take it easy.
- My daughters can't get married.

44:49.680 --> 44:51.760
- It's on you.
- Mother, stop.

44:52.600 --> 44:53.600
Madam, please spare me.

44:53.680 --> 44:55.480
I have a docile and sensible daughter.

44:55.560 --> 44:57.800
She is not married because we are poor.

44:58.400 --> 45:00.280
I fear she will grow old and die at home.

45:00.360 --> 45:02.040
Out of desperation, I resorted to theft.

45:02.120 --> 45:03.640
I beg you, madam, to be generous.

45:03.720 --> 45:05.000
Spare me this once.

45:05.080 --> 45:06.520
I will never do it again.

45:07.120 --> 45:09.320
- I am begging you.
- A girl from a poor family.

45:09.400 --> 45:11.840
To be old and unmarried,
that is pitiful indeed.

45:12.440 --> 45:15.680
Kind madam,
please have mercy and spare him.

45:16.800 --> 45:18.600
Please spare him for once.

45:18.680 --> 45:20.600
Please spare him.

45:22.920 --> 45:25.760
Alright. I won't pursue this any further.

45:26.520 --> 45:28.480
- I'll let you go.
- Merciful indeed.

45:29.240 --> 45:31.360
- Let him go.
- Thank you, madam.

45:31.440 --> 45:33.520
- Wait a moment.
- Good people are sure to be rewarded.

45:33.600 --> 45:35.360
Here, I give this to you.

45:35.440 --> 45:38.200
Consider it a good deed for myself.

45:38.280 --> 45:40.160
Also, as a contribution
to your daughter's dowry.

45:41.360 --> 45:42.240
Thank you, madam.

45:42.320 --> 45:44.560
- No need to thank me.
- Thank you.

45:44.640 --> 45:46.080
Thank you.

45:47.920 --> 45:48.840
The matter is settled.

45:48.920 --> 45:50.200
All is fine. Let's leave.

45:50.280 --> 45:51.400
Let's go.

45:52.240 --> 45:53.160
You may leave.

45:54.120 --> 45:56.280
Thank you.

45:56.360 --> 45:57.240
Thank you.

45:57.840 --> 46:00.800
How has this practice of expensive dowries
in Bianjing evolved to this point?

46:00.880 --> 46:02.440
Daughters of the poor can't get married.

46:03.360 --> 46:04.640
You are not locals, right?

46:05.360 --> 46:07.360
- Yes.
- You may not be aware.

46:07.440 --> 46:09.360
In Bianjing,
wealth is most important in a wife.

46:09.440 --> 46:11.160
The families that have daughters

46:11.240 --> 46:13.200
all start saving the dowry early.

46:13.280 --> 46:15.880
Hope the prep helps when
the daughter is the age for marriage.

46:15.960 --> 46:18.840
You mentioned having daughters.
I wonder how many young ladies you have.

46:18.920 --> 46:20.080
Five of them.

46:20.920 --> 46:21.840
Four.

46:24.680 --> 46:26.200
Only one has been married off.

46:27.520 --> 46:29.840
Pardon my frankness,
but allow me to add this.

46:29.920 --> 46:32.800
People said, "Thieves won't visit
the house with five daughters."

46:32.880 --> 46:34.640
Since you have five daughters,

46:34.720 --> 46:36.280
the dowries required for their marriages

46:36.360 --> 46:38.240
must amount to hundreds of millions.

46:38.320 --> 46:39.600
I'm afraid when the day comes,

46:39.680 --> 46:42.080
even thieves will look around.

46:43.680 --> 46:44.520
Hundreds of millions?

46:46.080 --> 46:49.040
With only these ordinary assets,
even the bodhisattvas wouldn't notice.

46:49.120 --> 46:51.240
With such stinginess, madam,

46:51.320 --> 46:53.160
it'll be hard for your daughters
to get married.

46:53.240 --> 46:55.400
You might as well
keep all these for yourself.

46:55.480 --> 46:57.040
You scoundrel.

46:57.120 --> 46:58.560
You old coffin.

46:58.640 --> 47:00.520
Blind to good intentions, infuriating!

47:00.600 --> 47:03.120
- Who are you talking about?
- Mother, it's alright now.

47:03.200 --> 47:05.200
- Don't you have…
- Mother.

47:05.280 --> 47:06.880
- Mother.
- Madam.

47:06.960 --> 47:07.960
- Quick. Pinch her.
- Okay.

47:08.040 --> 47:09.160
- Pinch her.
- Hit the acupoint.

49:37.160 --> 49:39.160
Subtitle translation by: Wenlong Zhong
